{"id":"57b799df6d953d656b8ef4404ff4df39f8940ff8","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1246083","title":"使用 GPT 6.1 Sol 和 Opus 5.5 制作的 Did Codex Reset 介绍视频，效果简直是天差地别","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"licoycn","excerpt":"分享创造 - @licoycn - 为 didcodexreset.com 制作的介绍视频，两者都是使用的 xhigh 的思考等级，其中 GPT-6.1 Sol 耗时 35 分钟，Opus 5.5 耗时 53 分钟，效果见如下：","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18144764\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e72f/93ee/237505_normal.png?m=1785372754\" alt=\"licoycn\" data-uid=\"237505\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/licoycn\">licoycn</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-02 08:50:11 +08:00\">23h 20m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>opus5.5 只消耗 Pro 订阅的 5h 的 50%不到</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18144766\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e72f/93ee/237505_normal.png?m=1785372754\" alt=\"licoycn\" data-uid=\"237505\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/licoycn\">licoycn</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-02 08:50:52 +08:00\">23h 20m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>gpt 消耗 pro200 的周额度差不多 5%左右</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18144845\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4f5a/f0a7/386538_normal.png?m=1648654953\" alt=\"AJDX3906\" data-uid=\"386538\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/AJDX3906\">AJDX3906</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-02 10:07:43 +08:00\">22h 3m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>是 llm 生成视频脚本，然后其他软件生成视频么？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18145210\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e72f/93ee/237505_normal.png?m=1785372754\" alt=\"licoycn\" data-uid=\"237505\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/licoycn\">licoycn</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-02 13:45:52 +08:00\">18h 25m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/quijote\">quijote</a> 我这个视频没用 dots ，直接 codex 对话生成的，Opus 是直接在 claude code 中</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18145284\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/fa71/f3b5/514560_normal.png?m=1760254986\" alt=\"raydied\" data-uid=\"514560\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/raydied\">raydied</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-02 14:34:27 +08:00\">17h 36m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>提示词、skill 也一样的话，效果确实 claude code 好一些。 如果 claude 不怎么封号的话，我还真切过去。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18145427\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a484/79ad/615527_normal.png?m=1732183896\" alt=\"oliveira\" data-uid=\"615527\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/oliveira\">oliveira</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-02 16:40:27 +08:00\">15h 30m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>Claude 像是直接生成视频，GPT 更像是 HTML PPT 再转成视频😂</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18145494\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e72f/93ee/237505_normal.png?m=1785372754\" alt=\"licoycn\" data-uid=\"237505\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/licoycn\">licoycn</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-02 17:39:24 +08:00\">14h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/oliveira\">oliveira</a> claude 是也是通过 web 2d 渲染出来的，gpt 没有让它分析用的啥技术 😂</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div></DIV>","content_text":"1 licoycn OP 23h 20m ago via iPhone opus5.5 只消耗 Pro 订阅的 5h 的 50%不到 2 licoycn OP 23h 20m ago via iPhone gpt 消耗 pro200 的周额度差不多 5%左右 3 AJDX3906 22h 3m ago via iPhone 是 llm 生成视频脚本，然后其他软件生成视频么？ 8 licoycn OP 18h 25m ago via iPhone @quijote 我这个视频没用 dots ，直接